{"sessionId":"L1-S15","number":15,"sessionTitle":"Slippery and Sticky","title":"The Icy Fish Market","titleCard":{"text":"Episode 15. The Icy Fish Market.","file":"/kids/audio/l1/L1-S15/title.ogg","dur":3.177,"env":"000tz32ymlmizzzl786azw4550nxtqssrqpl50000000000izzyzzyinjzta3qzprpbxzyvuph2a6ktqe089000000000000","words":[["Episode",0.1,0.88],["15.",0.88,1.2],["The",1.57,1.82],["Icy",1.82,2.07],["Fish",2.07,2.38],["Market.",2.38,2.79]],"voice":"narrator"},"previously":{"text":"The robot carried the heavy iron lantern up the ramp. Seven lights! Then Bolt slid across an icy floor…","file":"/kids/audio/l1/L1-S15/prev.ogg","dur":8.211,"env":"000qzzzxpnekk88f007dbvttsrqsrqrok500000000000urszzzz9lvqc950dhpvuwvuyd3qtiozq4sxyyvvvtvuruuvvtvs6kouyzwm20a7huktztsppqpqf2500000000002chsyckyzzzyuttqrqok302eklje600000000000tuyyogzyxue49ehki9nxkln5a96ssplahiiiqtn9lrtroekjggtra444rqroppool820000000","words":[["Last",0.11,0.61],["time...",0.61,1.11],["The",1.49,1.69],["robot",1.69,1.98],["carried",1.98,2.37],["the",2.37,2.57],["heavy",2.57,2.86],["iron",2.86,3.11],["lantern",3.11,3.49],["up",3.49,3.65],["the",3.65,3.85],["ramp.",3.85,4.09],["Seven",4.45,4.89],["lights!",4.89,5.39],["Then",5.75,6.07],["Bolt",6.07,6.38],["slid",6.38,6.7],["across",6.7,7.13],["an",7.13,7.34],["icy",7.34,7.6],["floor…",7.6,7.97]],"voice":"narrator"},"scenes":[{"setting":"The fish market: a cold store has leaked, and a patch of the floor is frozen and shiny. Past the door, soft beach sand.","action":"The robot hops onto the ice. It stops its wheels — but keeps sliding, spinning slowly, and bumps a stack of empty boxes.","seconds":35,"lines":[{"i":0,"who":"myrobot","guestName":null,"text":"Stop! I said stop! Wheee!","direction":null,"file":"/kids/audio/l1/L1-S15/0.ogg","dur":2.411,"env":"000483fzwttj300000000000003ni8bbmusj637b70qvsqqd500000000009pxuol70000000","words":[["Stop!",0.11,0.43],["I",0.89,1.02],["said",1.02,1.33],["stop!",1.33,1.63],["Wheee!",1.99,2.21]],"voice":"myrobot"},{"i":1,"who":"amara","guestName":null,"text":"The wheels stopped, but the robot kept going!","direction":null,"file":"/kids/audio/l1/L1-S15/1.ogg","dur":2.893,"env":"000000002stwyzzzvhkhfwzzvp304700004tob5vooszzxpfwrd30cpuk53490mwvvurnjefppod00000000000","words":[["The",0.12,0.35],["wheels",0.35,0.72],["stopped,",0.72,1.15],["but",1.15,1.38],["the",1.38,1.6],["robot",1.6,1.93],["kept",1.93,2.2],["going!",2.2,2.53]],"voice":"amara"}]},{"setting":"Nana walks onto the ice in tiny, careful steps, arms out.","action":"Then she steps onto the mat at the edge and walks normally.","seconds":35,"lines":[{"i":2,"who":"lucia","guestName":null,"text":"On ice, nothing holds your feet. Wheels can’t grip either.","direction":null,"file":"/kids/audio/l1/L1-S15/2.ogg","dur":4.689,"env":"008nsroqjbhrqqpmmf8oqrqqj403ouqpa9bunprn869kxvuvuvgdzmnuslae989axsonj50joe500000000000000hrzzzzwvsime0ffeswttil500hvwxk06ruvstp9msqrrm9000000","words":[["On",0.1,0.34],["ice,",0.34,0.66],["nothing",0.66,1.25],["holds",1.25,1.71],["your",1.71,2.09],["feet.",2.09,2.48],["Wheels",2.98,3.41],["can’t",3.41,3.73],["grip",3.73,4.04],["either.",4.04,4.48]],"voice":"lucia"},{"i":3,"who":"lucia","guestName":null,"text":"So go slowly. Slow things slide less.","direction":null,"file":"/kids/audio/l1/L1-S15/3.ogg","dur":4.106,"env":"006jolitypeizvepqnqbjzxuvtutuvututqg00000000000000bmqswtocqvuwvvvtq9dedqtrsqstskuvtuutm8qtrqsqrro57hrsrrrpoldnturtrmc200000","words":[["So",0.09,0.36],["go",0.36,0.62],["slowly.",0.62,1.2],["Slow",1.68,2.17],["things",2.17,2.83],["slide",2.83,3.41],["less.",3.41,3.89]],"voice":"lucia"}]},{"setting":"The beach outside. The robot drives onto the sand.","action":"The wheels sink a little and churn. The robot stops early, half-way to the mark.","seconds":45,"lines":[{"i":4,"who":"spark","guestName":null,"text":"Now the opposite! Sand is soft. The wheels sink in and it is hard to roll.","direction":null,"file":"/kids/audio/l1/L1-S15/4.ogg","dur":5.641,"env":"007kwrpnmmpqiastvmd6sqqj54lnhpmla5008j800000000mwvhztrr